"""Alembic migrations for aichat.

URL comes from the app (``DATABASE_URL`` / ``MYSQL_*`` / SQLite), see ``env.py``.

Typical flow after changing models in ``app/db.py``:

1. ``make migrate-rev m="add foo to users"``  — autogenerate a revision
2. Review ``migrations/versions/*.py`` (autogenerate is not always complete)
3. ``make migrate`` or restart the app (``init_db()`` runs ``upgrade head``)
"""
